            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baagaruka baabuuza bati: Ni ruganda ki omu nganda za Israeli orutainamukire Mizipa ahari MUKAMA? Ku baagiire kwetegyereza, baashanga hataine n'omwe orugire Yabeshi-gileadi okwija omu rusiisira ahu bateeraniire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okuba ku baabazire abantu, baashanga omu bantu ba Yabeshi-gileadi hatariho n'omwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.13.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 13:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eiteeraniro ryona ryatumayo abashaija amamanzi, abarikukira abandi boona, kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, baabaragiira bati: Mugyende mucwekyereze aba Yabeshi-gileadi na rurara, n'abakazi baabo n'abaana baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 31:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eki mube nikyo mwakora; mucwekyerereze kimwe abashaija boona na buri mukazi weena oraraire n'omushaija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ba Yabeshi-gileadi baashangayo abaishiki magana ana, abaabaire batakamanyaga bashaija; baabareeta omu rusiisira orwabaire ruri Shiilo omu nsi ya Kanaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
