                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ababenyamiini baakora batyo; baayekwatira abakazi omuri abo abaabaire nibaza kuzina, nk'oku abashaija baabaire nibaingana, baabatwara; bwanyima baagyenda, baagaruka omu buhunguzi bwabo, baayombeka endembo ezaabaire zisheenyirwe, baazituuramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
