              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abaisraeli baarugayo omu bunaku obwo, buri muntu yaagaruka omu ruganda rwe n'omuri beene waabo. Okuruga aho buri muntu yaaza omu buhunguzi bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
